WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.261 --> 00:00:01.432
- [Gary] This is the first 
time I've been here.

00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:03.481
- I'm gonna be so inspired here.
- [Gary] You think?

00:00:03.481 --> 00:00:05.531
I'm inspired regardless.

00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:08.282
I can be inspired, 
I can be inspired if

00:00:08.282 --> 00:00:10.093
they put me in like a jail cell.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:11.582
I live in an apartment now.

00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:13.813
It's crazy to me that 
I don't need a big house.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.853
You grow up, you
don't need a lot of room.

00:00:16.853 --> 00:00:18.753
With less room
you'll need less stuff.

00:00:18.753 --> 00:00:21.783
I don't need five
70 inch TV screens.

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:24.386
I don't need a watch, 
I don't even wear a watch.

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:26.432
I don't need a cool watch.

00:00:26.432 --> 00:00:28.594
I don't need a boat.

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:29.743
I need the game.

00:00:29.743 --> 00:00:31.553
I know myself.
I need the game.

00:00:31.553 --> 00:00:33.203
And that's how I act.

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:37.343
Other people want things
that they don't really need.

00:00:37.343 --> 00:00:38.873
Things that aren't
gonna make them happy.

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:40.194
They're not fulfilled inside.

00:00:40.194 --> 00:00:43.913
I'm always trying to challenge
people to get to their true self

00:00:43.913 --> 00:00:45.715
because once you 
understand yourself,

00:00:45.715 --> 00:00:47.699
self-awareness is maybe you
should be number two,

00:00:47.699 --> 00:00:50.103
number five, number seven, 
number twelve, maybe should be

00:00:50.103 --> 00:00:53.784
an accountant not an entrepreneur
because you could become the CFO

00:00:53.784 --> 00:00:58.043
of an entrepreneur's
company and make $1 billion.

00:00:58.043 --> 00:01:01.425
To me self-awareness is what are
you good at, what do you like,

00:01:01.425 --> 00:01:04.465
what puts you in a
position to be successful,

00:01:04.465 --> 00:01:05.624
then do that.

00:01:05.624 --> 00:01:07.633
(somber music)

